{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Trip Packing List Manager 是一款協助整理行李清單的旅遊工具，用戶只需選擇行程類型與日數，應用便會自動計算需要攜帶的物品，從每日必需品到一次性用品都一目瞭然。無論是城市週末遊、海灘度假、商務出差、露營遠足還是滑雪之旅都適用，特別適合旅客、家庭、背包客及希望避免遺漏重要物品的人。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，所有清單與行程只儲存在裝置本機，毋須註冊帳戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-178.webp\">\n<h2>智能清單按行程自動調整</h2>\n<p>應用內建多款行程範本，涵蓋城市週末、海灘假期、商務出差、露營遠足、滑雪及公路旅行，每款均按真實旅遊習慣設定打包規則。行程越長，系統會假設途中洗衣服並重複穿著，避免過度攜帶。用戶亦可自訂行程、隨時編輯物品、逐項打勾，並重複使用清單。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-315-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-316-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-317-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-318-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-319-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Trip Packing List Manager</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T16:39:16.056223+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:22:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T05:17:58.137447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:37:40.896063+00:00","content_hash":"66f1ed688b3f7b69163dea399f6bda37b3d54e3179ea5116a77bc6dbda0c4c51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}